Adds com.android.systemui.budik.ui.compose.Budik with the Budík OS tokens
(export/README.md, tokens.json): light/dark colours, radii 6/12/20 dp,
the hard 0x3 dp keycap shadow (no blur), JetBrains Mono / Schibsted
Grotesk / Instrument Sans as optional device fonts (from
fonts_customization.xml, platform default if missing), a pressable keycap
(BudikKey, the press sinks the key instead of a ripple) and the line icons
and logo as ImageVectors (no new resources).

Dual Shade panels use the opaque Budík background (#F5F6F7 / #0E0F11)
instead of the translucent blur colour.
